<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: challenge -->
  <DMS_GravekeeperChallengeTalk.label>盤查</DMS_GravekeeperChallengeTalk.label>
  <!-- [INITIATOR_nameDef] = 守墓人，[RECIPIENT_nameDef] = 被盤查的入侵者。句型照原版互動紀錄（第三人稱、句尾「。」）。
       [INITIATOR_nameDef] is the gravekeeper, [RECIPIENT_nameDef] the intruder; phrased like the vanilla interaction logs. -->
  <DMS_GravekeeperChallengeTalk.logRulesInitiator.rulesStrings>
    <li>r_logentry(p=3)->[INITIATOR_nameDef][challenged][RECIPIENT_nameDef]。</li>
    <li>r_logentry->[INITIATOR_nameDef][demanded][RECIPIENT_nameDef]出示[credential]。</li>
    <li>r_logentry->[INITIATOR_nameDef]命令[RECIPIENT_nameDef][order]。</li>
    <li>r_logentry->[INITIATOR_nameDef][scanned][RECIPIENT_nameDef]，卻找不到任何[credential]。</li>
    <li>r_logentry->[INITIATOR_nameDef]擋住[RECIPIENT_nameDef]的去路，並[challenged][RECIPIENT_objective]。</li>
    <li>r_logentry->[INITIATOR_nameDef]向[RECIPIENT_nameDef]宣讀了一段數百年前的安保條例。</li>

    <li>challenged(p=3)->盤查了</li>
    <li>challenged->攔下並盤問了</li>
    <li>challenged->審問了</li>
    <li>challenged->喝止了</li>
    <li>challenged->厲聲質問了</li>
    <li>challenged->例行盤查了</li>

    <li>demanded(p=3)->要求</li>
    <li>demanded->強硬地要求</li>
    <li>demanded->堅持要</li>
    <li>demanded->命令</li>

    <li>credential->授權</li>
    <li>credential->通行碼</li>
    <li>credential->身分證明</li>
    <li>credential->通行證</li>
    <li>credential->部隊番號</li>
    <li>credential->識別碼</li>

    <li>scanned->掃描了</li>
    <li>scanned->用感測器掃過</li>
    <li>scanned->檢查了</li>

    <li>order->停下</li>
    <li>order->站在原地不動</li>
    <li>order->撤離</li>
    <li>order->說明來意</li>
    <li>order->表明身分</li>
    <li>order->離開設施</li>
  </DMS_GravekeeperChallengeTalk.logRulesInitiator.rulesStrings>

</LanguageData>
